        <p source="#source-302638-302843"><seg n="2" type="heading" rend="dogyo" source="#source-302638-302710"><seg source="#source-302638-302656">八月二十九日</seg></seg><seg source="#source-302710-302713">　</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-302713-302839" corresp="#source-302713-302746 #source-302806-302839"><seg source="#source-302746-302806">〔巣鴨拘置所の顕治宛　目白より（封書）〕</seg></hi></p>
